# Local test files - not for Apps Script deployment.
#
# TestsLocal.js is not merely unwanted up there, it is BREAKING: Apps Script
# runs every file in one shared global scope, and TestsLocal.js declares
# `const DM_RECIPIENT_THRESHOLD` at top level, which InboxProcessor.js already
# declares. Two top-level `const`s of one name in one scope is a SyntaxError at
# load, so a push carrying both stops the whole project -- triage, bumps and
# both Web App endpoints -- not just the tests.
TestsLocal.js

# Git files
.git/**
.gitignore

# Clasp files
.clasp.json
.claspignore

# The nightly job's own working files. Tracked in git on purpose, never part of
# the deployed script.
.scheduler/**

# Not JavaScript, and not wanted in the project either way.
holon_fold.py

# Genre-research tooling: node-only (fs/import), never part of the deployed
# script. Same reason holon_fold.py is excluded -- pushing it would break the
# project (Apps Script has no import/fs/process).
analysis/**

# Brain client (#40): node-only ESM + its node_modules/manifest, driving Claude
# via the subscription-authenticated `claude` CLI (Agent SDK). Same reason as
# analysis/** above -- Apps Script has no import/fs/process/node_modules, so a
# push carrying any of this would break the project.
brain/**
node_modules/**
package.json
package-lock.json

# The recap generator (#41). Node ESM -- `import`, `fs`, `process`,
# `execFileSync` -- none of which exist in Apps Script. It runs on mandark,
# where the vault is, and drives Claude through brain/** above. Pushing it would
# break the project at load, the same way TestsLocal.js would.
recap/**
